10,000 Starship launches a year?

@TeslaLarry's answer is that it's "imminently doable" once Starbase Louisiana is up and running, but it takes a new factory and at least 8, possibly 12, launch platforms.

It also takes oxygen, helium, nitrogen and methane in huge quantities, https://t.co/BzEBS5Zmb3

